<ul>
<li>Record £8bn paid out in vital protection claims during 2024, Association of British Insurers (ABI)</li>
<li>Life insurance and cancer, Cancer Research UK</li>
<li>Types of insurance, Macmillan Cancer Support</li>
</ul>

